# ---- old copies of the source that nothing compiles ---------------------
# These are November drafts left over from before the project moved to one
# folder. They are not in the .vcxproj and including one by mistake is what
# broke the build once. Delete them when convenient.
Audio_1.h
Enemy_3.h
iMain_2.cpp
iMain_3.cpp

# ---- working files that are not part of the game ------------------------
# The .mpeg and .mp3 originals the .wav files were converted from. The game
# only ever loads the .wav, and these add about 21 MB to a clone.
Music/*.mpeg
Music/*.mp3
Music/*.aac
Images/prev_*.png

# ---- local helper, not part of the game ---------------------------------
DELETE-old-copies.bat

# ---- the high score table -----------------------------------------------
# scores.txt is written by the game as people play it. It is whoever ran this
# copy, not part of the game, and two people pushing their own would collide.
scores.txt
